  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Adaptive Water Resources Management in the Aral Sea Basin Sector Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will build on lessons learned from past and ongoing projects of ADB in water resources in Uzbekistan.  It will undertake a long-term, strategic and knowledge-based approach. The project will deliver climate adaptive solutions to water resources management by modernizing irrigation and drainage in selected subprojects within the Amu Darya and (selective reaches of the) Zarafshan River Basins in Uzbekistan.</narrative>
  </description>
