     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 3  Indicator 5</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Policy and institutions strengthened for climate adaptive and sustainable water resources management 
Indicator: At least 10% of WMO and WCA technical and management positions in subprojects filled by women 
Achievement: 0 
Progress/Status: The expected limitation on this activity is unavailability of female technical personnel due to lack of female specialists with professional education on technical and engineering skills. Technical professions as vocational and higher education are not popular among women. However, in order to attract women to existing vacant positions with technical background, the priority is given to women in recruitment for the existing vacancies. 
Data Source: BISAs&amp;apos; annual monitoring reports, PIU quarterly progress reports</narrative>
    </description>
